# route: level=w5_l1_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=hurts:0,eggs:0,wipes:0,x2_gates:3,min_checkpoints:4,min_kills:8
# The Beginner two-stream route of Red Mesa Trail in co-op (designer D5; duo macros written per hero and merged,
# one key set per player: P1|P2). Both heroes keep the club (no S), so the belt-invariance runner sees the same
# digests whatever special rides on either belt. All three co-op gates are crossed together:
# 'hop' (Shoulder Hop + the flower pot spring), 'plates' (leapfrog plate doors), 'gully' (two Shellback pincers).
# The beach, the tortoises, the rattler, checkpoint 1, the arch, the tortoise after it (side by side, P2 behind)
77:R|R,8:F|F,2:|,6:R|R,8:RU|RU,12:R|R,6:|,10:R|R,6:|,6:R|R,8:F|F,2:|,16:R|R,8:F|F,2:|,60:R|R,12:R|R,8:F|F
