# gate 'plates': P1 holds plate A (the lower tunnel's door opens), P2 walks through to plate B (the upper tunnel's door
# opens), P1 jumps onto the step and walks through the upper tunnel
14:R|R,32:|R,8:|,12:U|,10:|,6:RU|,6:U|,30:R|
# P1 drops off the upper tunnel's ledge, both go down the long slope to the plain, P1 clubs the tortoise
16:R|,62:R|R,8:F|R,4:|R,16:|
# gate 'gully': P1 drops into the gully in front of the first Shellback, P2 runs over the crust, drops through the
# hatch behind it and clubs its back
